"""
cues.py — the lexicon Stage A uses to spot a concept in a student prompt.

Per concept of data/chapter1_kg.json: code cues (Python regexes, matched
against the prompt and any student code) and word cues (lowercase phrases).
The knowledge itself (rules, execution facts, misconceptions, levels) comes
from the knowledge graph; this table only says how a concept shows up in
text. knowledge.py also adds each concept's id and label as word cues.

Cues for the 70 concepts that have a previous_id were carried over from the
earlier overlay; the rest were written for the v3.9 graph. DRAFT, for
teacher review.
"""

